sequenceDiagram
  participant T as Teacher (web UI)
  participant C as WhitelistProfileController
  participant MW as require_login + require_permission
  participant RB as RBACService.can_access_group
  participant PS as WhitelistProfileService
  participant GM as GroupModel
  participant DB as Mongo (whitelist_profiles, groups)

  T->>C: POST /api/groups/<gid>/profiles (name, domains)
  C->>MW: require_permission("whitelist_profile:create")
  MW->>RB: can_access_group(user, gid)?
  RB-->>C: allowed (teacher in group.teacher_ids)
  C->>PS: create_profile(gid, teacher_id, name, domains)
  PS->>DB: insert profile (active_profile=false)
  T->>C: POST /api/groups/<gid>/profiles/<pid>/activate
  C->>PS: activate_profile(pid, user)
  PS->>DB: set active_profile=true (others false)
  PS->>GM: bump group whitelist_version
  Note over GM: agent sync now serves profile entries instead of group base
